                                                "sense_id": "7b592fff-c65c-3608-a1e7-864d14a95958",
                                                "text": "By this time, Greg says, he was seeing triple and had a bad headache and Nate was seriously exhausted. Everyone was ibuprofened to the max. We reached the summit at 12:45 p.m., with Greg and Nate suffering the most."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2a51d7c-a7af-4d51-a681-63f96d3e7869",
                                                "sense_id": "7b592fff-c65c-3608-a1e7-864d14a95958",
                                                "text": "He remains behind in the nurse's office to bring down his blood pressure after you've been ice-packed, ibuprofened, and shuffled along to the assistant principal, where you sit alone for twenty minutes, […]"
                                            }
